{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_04",
  "title": "一个荒唐的早晨",
  "storyCode": "AD-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8800dfaa9f5dc45752d8bb82847826e0ba8f68e77cbfdc701ec37ce970a5b0f8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "道尔顿先生，您竟然真的替我多要了一场戏......还是空中悬吊的特技镜头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之前我怎么求斯蒂芬导演他都不愿意，您一说他竟然就答应了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "道尔顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小意思。我是格蕾塔女士亲自请来的男主演，斯蒂芬怎么敢不答应我的要求？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我还是第一次接触威亚......一定会好好地珍惜这次机会的！我先去准备了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "道尔顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "道尔顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "装得倒谦卑，要是我不知道你暗地里找斯蒂芬想动我主演的戏份，大概就被你骗过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "道尔顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "第一次接触威亚......正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "道尔顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "新人就应该有新人的姿态，就算到时候在天上吊上几个小时，也得撑住，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谢莉，谢莉！我又新加了一场戏，需要用一下威亚，你可以帮我准备一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道你很爱演戏，我也知道你很有热情，但你这是第几次新加戏了？你这是第几次扰乱我为整个剧组定下的拍摄进度了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大小姐，你有一点点责任心吗？我不会为了你这样轻飘飘的一句话改动整个排期，这个剧组不是围着你一个人转的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉谢莉，我不是故意要增加你的工作难度，但是道尔顿先生说他已经征得了导演的同意，这个应该是已经定下了的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "道尔顿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谢谢你，谢莉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（道尔顿昨天才和我骂过你一点新人的规矩都没有，怎么可能今天就好心给你加戏。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（威亚，是吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇，小劳拉，今天看上去真是光彩照人啊！下一场空中特技镜头又累又苦，没有一个演员会像你这么高兴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可现在是我最兴奋最幸福的时候了。下一场戏是这部电影里唯一一场完完整整属于我的戏份，我一定要把它拍好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，你真是太可爱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "千万别伤到自己，你要是实在累得不行了就来找我，今天晚上我会一直在自己的房间里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊！玛丽昂小姐，你是来帮迈克尔先生补妆的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劳拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我先去做准备了，晚点再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "见什么见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不、不见......不见......你别生气啊小玛丽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一不在我眼皮子底下就开始拈花惹草？我们才在一起多久你就厌倦了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "演戏的时候就在眉来眼去......喜欢年轻的就去找她啊，吊着我干嘛？之后的妆造你也让劳拉帮你做吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别说气话，亲爱的。我对你是真心实意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是你真的不喜欢，我以后再也不主动接触她了，我发誓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道你的那点小毛病，但现在正是你事业的上升期，不要做那些蠢事，也不要辜负我对你的心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个叫劳拉的年轻女孩既聒噪又招摇，她一定没安好心，不值得你花心思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "从现在开始，别主动接近她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不能跟她说话，也不能有肢体接触，哪怕她快死了都跟你没有关系......听明白了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "亲爱的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玛丽昂的眼神告诉他，她没开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我明白了，我答应你，全按你说的办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么还没到我的戏份啊，发生什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "道尔顿先生那儿有些事要处理，片场的人都调过去了，没有人给我下达指示......你看，还有个新人被晾在这儿呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，真可怜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你可不是同情心这么丰富的人，说吧，是不是想勾搭人家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还是你了解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让我去看看那个可怜的小美人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小玛丽早上刚生过气，我答应过她不再主动接近小劳拉......不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让她主动接近我不就好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迈克尔抬头向上看，劳拉纤瘦的身体被吊在空中，汗水一滴滴流下，打湿了一小片地板。\n女孩的神情有些疲惫，眼神却依旧很坚定，隐隐刺痛了迈克尔玩世不恭的心。\n威亚绳索咯吱咯吱地发出声响，迈克尔可以凭经验判断，劳拉穿戴的装置一定有什么不对劲的地方。\n不过——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那不是正好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小劳拉察觉到情况不对就会主动向我求救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这样一来我既会成为她心目中的英雄，顺理成章地跟她温存，又不算违反我对小玛丽发的誓......两全其美！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再多吊一会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "劳拉，为什么......为什么你还不向别人求助？我不是就在这里吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "已经过去了好几个小时，绳索的声音越来越不对劲了......这是哪里找来的设备，怎么会如此老旧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是......裂口？在保护绑带的地方？小劳拉不可能没注意到啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不行，我得提醒她，我得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "往前走的时候，迈克尔踩到了湿滑的水渍，在聚光灯强烈的高温中，劳拉逐渐处于脱水的状态。\n这是迈克尔永远无法理解的坚持和热爱，眼前这个女孩仿佛否定了他从业以来的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迈克尔回头，发现玛丽昂不知何时已经站在远处的墙角，眼神冰冷地看着自己和疲惫的女演员。\n“哪怕她快死了都跟你没有关系......听明白了吗？”\n迈克尔摸了摸头顶火红的耳朵，撤回了自己的脚步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......既然你选择自己承受代价，那就跟我没有任何关系了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是你要学的第一课，小劳拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "永远不要太认真，哪怕伤害他人也要保护自己，这才是最重要的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咯吱，咯吱。\n顶端的绳索已经拉伸到了极限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还不求救吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "迈克尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "迈克尔，你怎么了？你想到什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我跟你来到化妆间是要听你解释的，不是看你一惊一乍地发神经的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽昂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "莫伊拉说，你想离开这个地块，到底是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "亲爱的，我得带着你逃离这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是你第一次离开古堡，随剧团到这么远的地方演出吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "紧张吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......还好，老师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "其他老师们才是主演，我只是助演一个很小很小的角色，在舞台上绝大多数的戏份也只是旁观......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但当真正的演出在你面前发生，忍住不逃开，并没有那么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "孩子，这是你新的一课。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莱塔尼亚，鲁珀坎大区，某高塔"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（鼓掌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "精彩的演出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "自从顺利完成自己第一次作为主演的剧目后，你终于突破了瓶颈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你颈部细小的黑色结晶被遮掩得不留痕迹。观众只当你是璀璨夺目的主演，却不知你已成为迫近死亡的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如今，你的表演越发纯熟，你的歌声越发震撼人心，卢西恩......几乎看不出一丝匠气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是夸奖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不走吗？还是说，你想要在这里多待一会儿，再享受一会儿舞台的余韵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "余韵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是指，这些血腥味？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懵懂的孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大哥哥，请让让，你挡住路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懵懂的孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我要过去，我要回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想，猩红剧团可以收留这个孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "收留？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她并不知晓，自己的家乡已经不复存在，她并不知晓，此刻自己面前的这支队伍里，或许有些人身上还残留着她至亲的血腥味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "宿命的相逢，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就像曾经的你与剧团一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或许，我应该让你来当这个孩子的老师，教她怎样融入剧团，怎样拥抱新的人生......教她，重走一遍你的来路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下台之后，演出继续？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，你还记得我说过的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，生活本身便是最好的戏剧，宿命的美学从不局限于载体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懵懂的孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......大哥哥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么样，卢西恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你考虑清楚了吗？现在的你，应该能决定了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "清醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（慵懒的哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么了，女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "执拗的涩味......你的情绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难以下咽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "倒是谈不上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过来到这个地块以后，你回想过往的次数越发多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这说明我们正在靠近他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你敏锐地察觉到了那个统筹的异样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "遗憾，我尚未能挖出更多的线索，她的惨剧便已经发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你利用了那个摄影助理，你故意抖出天灾的消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那份文件出现的时机和方式都太过巧合，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "参演过足够多的剧目，便不难知晓，当这样明显的线索出现在我们面前，它便一定会发挥作用，推动故事往下进行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "道尔顿的死，只是一个开头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有的伏笔已被铺陈，一切的脉络已被写定，没有人能扯回已经拉开的大幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唯有，唯有让故事来到谢幕前的高潮，作者才会现身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......而我才能，杀死他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当心点，卢西恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是说，当心你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我刚刚说过，你的情绪，充满了执拗的涩味......这很危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我向你道歉，Miss.Christine。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不会让你忍受太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
